    *   **Multi-Color Seeds**: If a seed component has multiple colors (adjacent but different), the Template Shape should be split. The pixels are assigned colors based on their column position relative to the seed's color boundary. Typically, the "Left" part of the template gets the "Left" color and the "Right" part gets the "Right" color.

